#: dtime.cpp:58
msgid "Here you can change the system date's month."
msgstr "Livir tu kari meh(mang) ya rêkkewt(Datum)a sîstemê biguhere."

#: dtime.cpp:64
msgid "Here you can change the system date's year."
msgstr "Livir tu kari sala rêkkewta (date) sîtemê biguhere."

#: dtime.cpp:68
msgid "Here you can change the system date's day of the month."
msgstr "Livir tu kari roja rêkkewta (date) sîtemê biguhere."

#: dtime.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or "
"seconds field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down "
"buttons to the right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""
"Livir tu kari demjimêra sîstemê biguhere. Bitikîne ser xana demjimêran, hurdeman"
"yan çirkan jibo ku tu nirxên wane biguherîne, herweha tu kari nirxan bi dûgma "
"jêr û jor biguherîne yanjî nirxên nuh binivîsîne."

#: dtime.cpp:271
msgid "Can not set date."
msgstr "Rêkkewt (date) nayête sazkirin."

#: dtime.cpp:339 main.cpp:91
msgid ""
"<h1>Date & Time</h1> This control module can be used to set the system date "
"and time. As these settings do not only affect you as a user, but rather the "
"whole system, you can only change these settings when you start the Control "
"Center as root. If you don't have the root password, but feel the system "
"time should be corrected, please contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Rêkewt (date) û Dem</h1> Ev kontrolmodul bikarbîne jibo guhrîna rêkkewt "
"û dema systemê. Jiber ku ev danan ji sîstema te re ye û ne bitenê ji "
"te re ye, tu kari vêna tenê biguhere heger tu wek root (kok) sentera kontrolê bajo. "
"Heger tu nihênî (password)ê nasnake, û di ramana te de Dem û Rêkkewta systemê "
"şaşe fermo ji birêvebirê systemê (root) re bêje hew ew bitenê kari vî tiştî bike."

#: tzone.cpp:64
msgid "Current time zone: "
msgstr "Zone ya Demî ya aktuel: "

#: tzone.cpp:72
msgid "To change the time zone, select your area from the list below:"
msgstr ""
"Jibo gohrîna Zone ya demê, Cihê runiştina xwe hilbijêre ji vê "
"Lista jêr:"

#: tzone.cpp:95 tzone.cpp:203
msgid "[No selection]"
msgstr "[Hilbijartin nîne]"

#: tzone.cpp:154
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Nenas"

#: tzone.cpp:291
msgid "Error setting new Time Zone!"
msgstr "Şaştî çêbu çaxha Zone ya demî hate sazkirin."

#: tzone.cpp:292
msgid "Timezone Error"
msgstr "Şaştîya Zone ya demî"

